<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <%- include ("../partials/header.ejs") %>
</head>

<body>

  <%- include ("../partials/nav.ejs") %>

<div class="jumbotron text-center">
  <div class="container">
    <a href="/" class="lang-logo">
      <img src="/lang-logo.png">
    </a>
    <h1>Node.js App - AWS EC2 Ready</h1>
    <p>This is a simple Node.js application with Express.js, configured and ready for deployment on AWS EC2 using PM2.</p>
    <p><strong>Environment:</strong> <%= environment %></p>
    <a type="button" class="btn btn-lg btn-primary" href="/api/status"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-info-sign"></span> API Status</a>
    <a type="button" class="btn btn-lg btn-default" href="/health"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-heart"></span> Health Check</a>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <h3><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-check"></span> What's Included</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>✓ Express.js server with EJS templating</li>
        <li>✓ PM2 configuration for cluster mode</li>
        <li>✓ Health check endpoint (/health)</li>
        <li>✓ API status endpoints (/api/status, /api/info)</li>
        <li>✓ Proper error handling & logging</li>
        <li>✓ Graceful shutdown (SIGTERM, SIGINT)</li>
        <li>✓ Environment-based configuration</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <h3><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-cloud-upload"></span> Deployment</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Cloud Platform:</strong> AWS EC2</li>
        <li><strong>Process Manager:</strong> PM2 (cluster mode)</li>
        <li><strong>Node.js Version:</strong> 20.x or newer</li>
        <li><strong>Port:</strong> 5006 (configurable via PORT env var)</li>
        <li><strong>Auto-restart:</strong> Enabled on EC2 reboot</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <a href="/aws-deployment-guide" class="btn btn-info">📖 Deployment Guide</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr>

  <div class="row" style="margin-top:2em">
    <div class="col-md-12">
      <h3><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span> Quick Deploy Script</h3>
      <p>Use the included deploy.sh script for automated EC2 deployment:</p>
      <pre>./deploy.sh &lt;EC2_IP&gt; ~/.ssh/my-key.pem ubuntu</pre>
      <p class="text-muted">The script handles: SSH connection, file upload, dependencies, PM2 setup, and auto-start configuration.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row" style="margin-top:2em">
    <div class="col-md-12">
      <h3><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-cog"></span> API Endpoints</h3>
      <table class="table table-bordered">
        <tr>
          <th>Endpoint</th>
          <th>Purpose</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><code>/health</code></td>
          <td>Health check for load balancers (returns uptime, status)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><code>/api/status</code></td>
          <td>Application status with version and uptime</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><code>/api/info</code></td>
          <td>Application information (name, Node.js version, platform)</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row" style="margin-top:2em; margin-bottom:2em">
    <div class="col-md-12">
      <p class="text-center text-muted">
        <small>Last Updated: <%= timestamp %></small>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
